%% D10 - Password algorithm. Cryptographic picks guarantee each selected set, then a cryptographic Fisher-Yates shuffle removes fixed positions.
flowchart TD
    A(["GeneratePassword(options)"]) --> V{"Options valid,<br/>length 4-64,<br/>any set?"}
    V -- No --> X["Throw argument exception"]
    V -- Yes --> S["Build selected sets and combined pool"]
    S --> G["For each selected set:<br/>pick one character with RandomNumberGenerator.GetInt32"]
    G --> F{"Output length reached?"}
    F -- No --> R["Pick from combined pool with RandomNumberGenerator.GetInt32"]
    R --> F
    F -- Yes --> Sh["Fisher-Yates shuffle:<br/>for i from n-1 down to 1, choose j in 0..i<br/>using RandomNumberGenerator.GetInt32"]
    Sh --> O["Return shuffled string"]
